ii) The applicant will cooperate in the investigation/trial, as the case may be;
iii) The applicant will not indulge himself in extending inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025:MPHC-GWL:17217 4 MCRC-25344-2025 the facts of the case so as to dissuade him/her from disclosing such facts to the Court or to the Police Officer, as the case may be;
